+       the accent.
+     - navy: the book locked in a banker's vault -- deep navy cover, gold
+       trim instead of brass.
+   Every color in the app is one of these variables (via tailwind.config.ts),
+   so switching themes is only ever an attribute change on <html>, never a
+   per-page or per-component edit.
